verdicts.instead:
Define canonical(text) once, in package ported:
- strip a BOM;
- CRLF to LF;
- trim trailing newlines, then add exactly one.
Every Edition is sha256(canonical(text)), in-tree sources included, so git blob ids are dropped. For a ledger body, text is the JSON-decoded `body` string of its finish item, not the raw column. M1's snapshot check, check (d), code review's in-place SELECT and SC-045 all call the same function.

